#### Integration with Documentation Platform

**MkDocs Integration** (per ADR-TEC-001):

- ADRs automatically published to documentation site
- Full-text search across all ADRs
- Navigation structure mirrors domain organization
- Cross-referencing between ADRs, standards, and principles

**Content Manifest Configuration:**

```json
{
  "prod": {
    "content": {
      "directories": [
        "decisions",
        "foundation",
        "standards",
        "guiding-principles"
      ]
    },
    "navigation": {
      "directories": [
        "decisions"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
